  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SammeSol - Engagementsinitiativet 2024-28</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant covers the development and operation of a four-year engagement project executed by Democracy x and UNLive. The project aims to nuance the Danish publics&apos; understanding of Africa and the global south. By facilitating meetings between Danes and Africans around common interests and challenges, the aim is to promote relationships and identification and thereby increase the understanding and experience that Africa is not just a neighboring continent, but a continent of neighbours.

The project contributes both to fulfilling the Danish Ministry of Foreign Affairs&apos;s information obligation (cf. Act on Development Cooperation &#xa7; 6)  with a focus on creating new narratives about Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
